{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JDG","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"士師記","commonName":"士師記","title":"士師記","order":7,"numberOfChapters":21,"sha256":"212088674548da5a72a7014867e18c2e0357e626ca5eeab0a215cd4cc9fde0b7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/1.json","lastChapterNumber":21,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/21.json","totalNumberOfVerses":616},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["米迦的神像"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以法蓮山區住了一個名叫米迦的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他對母親說：「你那一千一百塊銀子被拿走了，你因此說了咒詛的話，我都聽見了。看啊，銀子在我這裡，是我拿去的。」他母親說：「我兒啊，願耶和華賜福給你！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["米迦把一千一百塊銀子還給母親。他母親說：「我要為我兒把這些銀子獻給耶和華，用來雕刻、鑄造神像。我會把銀子交還給你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["米迦把銀子還給母親後，他母親拿出二百塊銀子交給銀匠雕刻、鑄造神像，放在米迦的房子裡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["米迦有一個神廟，他製造了一件以弗得和一些家庭神像，並指派他的一個兒子做祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那時，以色列沒有王，人人各行其是。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["猶大的伯利恆住著一個年輕的利未人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他離開伯利恆想到別的地方居住，一路走到以法蓮山區米迦的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["米迦問他：「你從哪裡來？」他回答說：「我是從猶大的伯利恆來的利未人，要找一個住的地方。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["米迦說：「你就住在我這裡吧，做我的師父和祭司。我每年給你十塊銀子，還為你提供衣服和飲食。」利未人就進了米迦的家，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["住了下來。米迦待他就像待自己的兒子一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["這樣，米迦派他做祭司，讓他住在自己家裡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["米迦說：「現在我有一個利未人做我的祭司，我知道耶和華一定會恩待我。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JDG/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}